    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy Hotel</i> is a fast-paced horror mini-game collection, handcrafted by a solo developer, that challenges you to survive creepy, handcrafted floors in a haunted hotel. Inspired by the relentless descent of <i>Exit 8</i>, <i>Happy Hotel</i> delivers a mix of platforming, short puzzles, and suspenseful surprises as you fight to escape its sinister halls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Floor Challenges</strong>: Each playthrough features a selection of unique, handcrafted floors, ensuring every descent offers fresh and unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Survival</strong>: Quick deaths send you back to the start, making each move critical as you adapt to traps and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Platforming and Puzzles</strong>: From precise jumps to quick-thinking challenges, each floor tests your skills in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Happy, the Mascot</strong>: Inspired by creepy-cute mascot horror, Happy the bunny doll lurks on each floor, adding a constant source of tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variable Playtime</strong>: Depending on your skill, playtime ranges from a quick 15 minutes to a challenging 2 hours, making it perfect for short bursts or longer sessions.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy Hotel</i> is a fast-paced horror mini-game collection, handcrafted by a solo developer, that challenges you to survive creepy, handcrafted floors in a haunted hotel. Inspired by the relentless descent of <i>Exit 8</i>, <i>Happy Hotel</i> delivers a mix of platforming, short puzzles, and suspenseful surprises as you fight to escape its sinister halls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Floor Challenges</strong>: Each playthrough features a selection of unique, handcrafted floors, ensuring every descent offers fresh and unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Survival</strong>: Quick deaths send you back to the start, making each move critical as you adapt to traps and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Platforming and Puzzles</strong>: From precise jumps to quick-thinking challenges, each floor tests your skills in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Happy, the Mascot</strong>: Inspired by creepy-cute mascot horror, Happy the bunny doll lurks on each floor, adding a constant source of tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variable Playtime</strong>: Depending on your skill, playtime ranges from a quick 15 minutes to a challenging 2 hours, making it perfect for short bursts or longer sessions.</p></li></ul>",
